      <title>Intel本周归档开源字体项目后迅速逆转 撤销取消决定</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260913/Intel%E6%9C%AC%E5%91%A8%E5%BD%92%E6%A1%A3%E5%BC%80%E6%BA%90%E5%AD%97%E4%BD%93%E9%A1%B9%E7%9B%AE%E5%90%8E%E8%BF%85%E9%80%9F%E9%80%86%E8%BD%AC-%E6%92%A4%E9%94%80%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%E5%86%B3%E5%AE%9A/</link>
